+issueNumber: MDL-88886
+notes:
+  core_backup:
+    - message: >
+        The backup `file_logger` now stores (and serialises) paths located
+        directly within `$CFG->backuptempdir` as relative paths (just the
+        filename), resolving the full path on the fly against the current
+        `$CFG->backuptempdir`. The constructor accepts a bare filename, which
+        is considered relative to `$CFG->backuptempdir`. Use the new
+        `file_logger::get_fullpath()` method to obtain the absolute path.
+      type: changed
